            "review_title": "Review at Euro Bistro",
            "review_text": "Tracy C\nSan Jose, California516 contributions\n0\nDelicious Shakes and Great Service!\nJul 2018 • Friends\nWe stumbled upon Euro Bistro after watching the Dragon Bridge show from the southern pedestrian bridge. The family who runs this place are some of the friendliest I have met in Vietnam (the owner even opened the door for us to our ride back to our hotel!). But besides the friendly service, the shakes are to die for! My friend got the mango yogurt shake and I got their \"special\" shake and both left us scraping the bottom of our glasses. Every worker came up to us to make sure we were happy with our selections and all we could do was give them a two thumbs up. Quench your thirst at the Euro Bistro with their amazing shakes...you will not be disappointed!\nRead more\nWritten July 25, 2018\nEuro Bistro Danang\nThank you so much and really want to serve you again!!!\nWritten February 26, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
